WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.452 --> 00:00:02.285
LARRY, GOOD TO SEE YOU TONIGHT.

00:00:02.286 --> 00:00:03.686
&gt;&gt; YOU'VE GOT IT.

00:00:03.687 --> 00:00:06.089
THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.256
&gt;&gt; Tucker: MOSTLY FROM

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.224
DEMOCRATS, BUT ALSO FROM SOME

00:00:08.225 --> 00:00:11.961
REPUBLICANS FOR NEW UNCONTROLLED

00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:13.162
MEASURES.

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:15.198
DEMANDED OUTRIGHT GUN

00:00:15.199 --> 00:00:18.501
COMPENSATION

00:00:18.502 --> 00:00:19.736
CONFISCATION.

00:00:19.737 --> 00:00:22.138
THANKS A LOT FOR COMING ON.

00:00:22.139 --> 00:00:23.106
WE DON'T AGREE ON MUCH.

00:00:23.107 --> 00:00:25.008
I THINK YOU ARE A MAN OF GOOD

00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:25.308
FAITH.

00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:27.877
I LOVE HAVING YOU ON THE SHOW,

00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:30.513
BUT WE DISAGREE ON MOST ISSUES.

00:00:30.514 --> 00:00:31.180
YOU SAID SOMETHING REALLY

00:00:31.181 --> 00:00:32.915
INTERESTING TO ME, AND I WANTED

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:35.218
YOU TO EXPLAIN IT MORE FULLY TO

00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:39.022
OUR AUDIENCE.

00:00:39.023 --> 00:00:40.757
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE SOME COMMON SENSE

00:00:40.758 --> 00:00:43.292
MEASURES THAT I THINK MAKES

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:43.926
SENSE.

00:00:43.927 --> 00:00:46.562
EVEN LIMITING THE CAPACITY OF A

00:00:46.563 --> 00:00:47.897
MAGAZINE.

00:00:47.898 --> 00:00:50.833
WE SAW IN CALIFORNIA WHERE A GUY

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:52.869
HAD A 75 ROUND DRUM CONNECTED TO

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:53.469
HIS WEAPON.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:53.970
I'M AGAINST THAT.

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:56.572
I DON'T THINK THAT WE NEED THAT

00:00:56.573 --> 00:01:01.277
I THINK WE NEED BACKGROUND

00:01:01.278 --> 00:01:01.611
CHECKS.

00:01:01.612 --> 00:01:02.478
WHEN WE LOOK AT THE HISTORY OF

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.747
GUN CONTROL IN THIS COUNTRY, IT

00:01:04.748 --> 00:01:06.549
HAS BEEN TO KEEP GUNS OUT OF THE

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:12.989
HANDS OF BLACK PEOPLE.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:13.690
I WOULD POINT ANYONE TO ADAM

00:01:13.691 --> 00:01:16.959
WINKLER'S WORK OUT OF UCLA.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:21.064
IT WAS TO KEEP HANDS OUT OF BOTH

00:01:21.065 --> 00:01:22.165
ENSLAVED AND FREE AFRICAN

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:22.498
PEOPLE.

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:27.637
AND THEN YOU GO TO ROGER, WHO

00:01:27.638 --> 00:01:28.504
WROTE THE INFAMOUS DRED SCOTT.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:30.907
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT HE SAID

00:01:30.908 --> 00:01:31.774
WAS THAT HE DIDN'T THINK THAT

00:01:31.775 --> 00:01:35.278
BLACK PEOPLE HAD RIGHTS THAT

00:01:35.279 --> 00:01:37.013
WHITE PEOPLE COULD RESPECT, IN

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:38.347
PART, BECAUSE HE THOUGHT THAT IF

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:40.283
YOU EXTENDED THOSE RIGHTS, THAT

00:01:40.284 --> 00:01:41.050
THEY WOULD HAVE THE RIGHTS TO

00:01:41.051 --> 00:01:44.387
CARRY AND OWN GUNS.

00:01:44.388 --> 00:01:52.395
THE KU KLUX KLAN, THE TERRORIST

00:01:52.396 --> 00:01:53.062
GROUP, CONSERVATIVE GROUP.

00:01:53.063 --> 00:01:58.101
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DEMOCRATIC PARTY.

00:01:58.102 --> 00:02:01.070
I'M SANE, THEY WERE DEMOCRATS.

00:02:01.071 --> 00:02:02.972
&gt;&gt; AT THE SAME TIME, THEY WERE

00:02:02.973 --> 00:02:05.308
ADVOCATES OF GUN CONTROL.

00:02:05.309 --> 00:02:06.542
SO OBVIOUSLY, WHEN YOU LOOK AT

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:08.911
THE HISTORY OF THE ISSUE, I

00:02:08.912 --> 00:02:09.579
THINK THAT AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.848
PEOPLE SHOULD BE A LITTLE LEERY

00:02:11.849 --> 00:02:13.282
ABOUT PEOPLE WANTING TO COME

00:02:13.283 --> 00:02:14.250
AROUND AND TAKE THEIR GUNS.

00:02:14.251 --> 00:02:16.319
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DO YOU THINK?

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:16.652
[LAUGHS]

00:02:16.653 --> 00:02:17.520
YEAH.

00:02:17.521 --> 00:02:18.788
I'M SORRY TO LAUGH, BUT YOU MAKE

00:02:18.789 --> 00:02:21.324
A COMPELLING CASE, BECAUSE WHAT

00:02:21.325 --> 00:02:24.861
YOU SAY IS TRUE.

00:02:24.862 --> 00:02:26.596
WHEN YOU WANT TO OPPRESS

00:02:26.597 --> 00:02:27.363
SOMEBODY, YOU DISARM THEM FIRST.

00:02:27.364 --> 00:02:30.333
OF COURSE.

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:31.801
YOU'VE SEEN THAT IN TOTALLY

00:02:31.802 --> 00:02:34.036
HOMOGENEOUS, WHERE RACE IS NOT A

00:02:34.037 --> 00:02:34.670
FACTOR.

00:02:34.671 --> 00:02:35.438
THE FIRST THING THE GOVERNMENT

00:02:35.439 --> 00:02:37.473
DOES IS DISARM THE POPULATION

00:02:37.474 --> 00:02:40.476
BEFORE DOING SOMETHING HORRIBLE.

00:02:40.477 --> 00:02:40.843
OBVIOUSLY.

00:02:40.844 --> 00:02:43.312
SO BECAUSE OF WHAT YOU SAID IS

00:02:43.313 --> 00:02:45.081
SO CLEARLY TRUE, WHY IS IT SO

00:02:45.082 --> 00:02:46.115
RARELY SET OUT LOUD?

00:02:46.116 --> 00:02:49.285
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I'M NOT EXACTLY

00:02:49.286 --> 00:02:50.920
SURE.

00:02:50.921 --> 00:02:53.589
SOME OF OUR CIVIL RIGHTS HEROES

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.391
THAT ARE OFTEN TIMES NOT

00:02:55.392 --> 00:02:56.092
ACKNOWLEDGED, WHETHER WE ARE

00:02:56.093 --> 00:03:00.096
TALKING ABOUT THE DEACONS, OR WE

00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:02.832
ARE TALKING ABOUT ROBERT OFF

00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:03.499
WILLIAM.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.233
I'M NOT SURE WHY PEOPLE DON'T

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:08.838
STATE THIS.

00:03:08.839 --> 00:03:09.839
DR. KING, AT ONE POINT, WAS

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.040
CERTAINLY A GUN OWNER.

00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:14.210
AT ONE POINT, THEY ACTUALLY

00:03:14.211 --> 00:03:16.012
SAID, A JOURNALIST NEARLY SAT ON

00:03:16.013 --> 00:03:17.480
TOP OF THE GUN IN HIS HOME AND

00:03:17.481 --> 00:03:22.285
CALLED HIS HOME IN ARSENAL.

00:03:22.286 --> 00:03:22.819
MARTIN LUTHER KING.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:23.753
AT THE SAME TIME, THERE ARE

00:03:23.754 --> 00:03:25.121
ORGANIZATIONS THAT HAVE WORKED

00:03:25.122 --> 00:03:28.391
AGAINST BLACK PEOPLE THAT ARE

00:03:28.392 --> 00:03:28.724
PRO-GUN.

00:03:28.725 --> 00:03:31.828
THEY ARE PRO-GUN-CONTROL WHEN IT

00:03:31.829 --> 00:03:34.730
COMES TO BLACK PEOPLE, LIKE THE

00:03:34.731 --> 00:03:35.264
NRA.

00:03:35.265 --> 00:03:35.932
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'M NOT HERE TO

00:03:35.933 --> 00:03:37.967
SPEAK FOR THE NRA, BUT AS

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:39.435
SOMEONE WHO BELIEVES IN THE

00:03:39.436 --> 00:03:40.970
SECOND AMENDMENT, I BELIEVE IT'S

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:43.039
UNIVERSAL PRINCIPLE THAT

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:47.143
APPLIES, IT GOES WITHOUT SAYING.

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:48.911
IT APPLIES TO ALL HUMAN BEINGS.

00:03:48.912 --> 00:03:49.779
IT'S A GOD-GIVEN RIGHT.

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:53.516
THE RIGHT TO SELF-DEFENSE.

00:03:53.517 --> 00:03:54.917
I THINK MOST PEOPLE OF GOODWILL

00:03:54.918 --> 00:03:55.351
BELIEVE THAT.

00:03:55.352 --> 00:03:57.320
HOW MUCH WILL YOU TAKE FOR

00:03:57.321 --> 00:03:58.721
SAYING SOMETHING SO OBVIOUS

00:03:58.722 --> 00:04:00.289
CUSTOMER &gt;&gt; I TAKE A EVERY TIME

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:01.023
I'M ON THIS SHOW FROM ONE SIDE

00:04:01.024 --> 00:04:02.792
OR THE OTHER.

00:04:02.793 --> 00:04:06.629
SO I THINK I'M PREPARED.

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:11.969
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR COMING ON.

